cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below, and cite the data sources listed in docs/DATA_SOURCES.md (SINAN/OpenDataSUS, INMET, IBGE)."
type: software
title: "Arbovirus surveillance in Brazil, 2016-2026: reproducible R pipeline"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible R pipeline for dengue, chikungunya and Zika notifications in the
  27 Brazilian federative units, monthly, 2016-2026: ETL from the raw SINAN,
  INMET and IBGE files, descriptive and trend analyses, climate correlations
  and regression models, spatial autocorrelation, advanced analyses and
  publication figures with journal-style source data.
authors:
  - alias: eduramosalves
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-10-13"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/eduramosalves/arbovirus-surveillance-brazil-r"
url: "https://github.com/eduramosalves/arbovirus-surveillance-brazil-r"
keywords:
  - dengue
  - chikungunya
  - zika
  - arbovirus
  - Brazil
  - epidemiology
  - spatial analysis
  - R
# Literature the results are discussed against; see docs/LITERATURE_CONTEXT.md. Authors are first author
# plus "et al."; full author lists are in the papers.
